# Project Context

Internal notes for developers and AI. Not part of the user-facing app.

Source of truth for design tokens is `design/tokens.json`, mirrored in `src/index.css` (`@theme`) and `src/components/controlStyles.ts` (shared button, field, tab, card, and dialog classes). Change all three together.

## Color Palette

### Main (blue scale, light to saturated)

| Token    | Hex       |
| -------- | --------- |
| main-100 | `#eff3fd` |
| main-200 | `#e1e9fc` |
| main-300 | `#cedbf8` |
| main-400 | `#bdcdf2` |
| main-500 | `#a9bdea` |
| main-600 | `#97ade0` |
| main-700 | `#859dd6` |

### Other / Sub Detail (warm neutrals and creams)

| Token      | Hex       |
| ---------- | --------- |
| detail-100 | `#fbf8ef` |
| detail-200 | `#f4efd4` |
| detail-300 | `#e6d4a4` |
| detail-400 | `#f7f4ec` |
