### Roles

| Token             | Hex       | Use                                  |
| ----------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------ |
| primary           | `#2b56da` | Filled buttons, selected tabs, links |
| primary-pressed   | `#294aae` | Hover/pressed filled buttons         |
| ink               | `#1c212e` | Headings and body text               |
| ink-secondary     | `#585f6f` | Supporting text                      |
| ink-muted         | `#676f7e` | Placeholders, hints, counts          |
| line              | `#c8d1e4` | Borders and dividers                 |
| surface-muted     | `#f4f6f8` | Neutral badges and quiet fills       |

Department colors (`src/data/subjects.ts`) are accents only: a 4px card edge, chip dots, and grade badges. Cards stay white.

## Typography

The site's main font is `font-sans` (Tailwind utility class).

## Project Notes

- Student catalog layout: department chips above the course list (`DepartmentTabs`), bookmarks in a resizable right panel (`BookmarksPanel`). Teacher catalog uses the same chips. Full and Compact are a segmented switch.
